; zerobus-rest-async (§4.2): the Async instantiation of the stateless REST
; insert helper. The Async counterpart of zerobus-rest (Lwt); reuses
; zerobus-core's OAuth body-builder over cohttp-async.
;
; (optional): the whole library needs cohttp-async (which downgrades cohttp
; 6.0->5.3 — benign, see doc/arch/tls_async_status.md), so it builds ONLY on a
; switch where cohttp-async is installed and vanishes otherwise. This mirrors the
; built-in Async OAuth select — the canonical fl414 switch (no cohttp-async) does
; not build it, and it is not in standard CI.
(library
 (name zerobus_rest_async)
 (public_name zerobus-rest-async)
 (optional)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_let))
 (libraries
  zerobus-core
  core
  async
  cohttp-async
  yojson
  uri
  base64))
